  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nicaragua holding the achievements and consolidating the actions aimed at pre-elimination of Malaria - Nicaragua (01-Jan-2025-31-Dec-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nicaragua, Malaria, Federaci&#xf3;n Red NICASALUD (NICASALUD)This program has the following goals: Reducci&#xf3;n del 91,% de los casos de malaria de transmisi&#xf3;n local para 2027/ 91.% reduction of locally transmitted malaria cases by 2027. The objectives of this program are: Garantizar el acceso universal desde el Modelo de Salud Familiar y Comunitario (MOSAFC) mediante la implementaci&#xf3;n de la estrategia DTIR/ Ensure universal access from the Family and Community Health Model (MOSAFC) by implementing the DTIR strategy.  Fortalecer la gesti&#xf3;n del an&#xe1;lisis de focos integrando el sistema de vigilancia epidemiol&#xf3;gica, parasitol&#xf3;gica y entomol&#xf3;gica seg&#xfa;n estratificaci&#xf3;n de riesgo a nivel nacional/ Strengthen foci analysis management by integrating the epidemiological, parasitological and entomological surveillance system according to risk stratification at the national level.  Acelerar los esfuerzos hacia la eliminaci&#xf3;n de la malaria con participaci&#xf3;n multisectorial inter e intrainstitucional con estrategias de cambio de comportamiento y desarrollo de acuerdos binacionales/ Accelerate efforts towards malaria elimination with inter- and intra-institutional multisectoral participation with strategies for behavioral change and development of binational agreements.</narrative>
  </description>
